      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-evolve bundle patch layer.\n#\n# Inserts the dsh-evolve plugin row into any profile that stacks this bundle.\n# The row is mounted beside the official agent loop; removing the bundle (or\n# disabling this row) restores stock DeepSeek Harness behavior — the plugin\n# never modifies core, the loop, or the durable session schema.\n\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-evolve\n      name: dsh-evolve\n      config:\n        enabled: true\n        # Candidate runtime policy: 'baseline' (observe-only control) or\n        # 'reset-v1' (strategy reset enabled). Override per profile/arm via a\n        # later patch layer.\n        recipe: reset-v1"
    }
  ],
